        "Hi, Tom!",
        "Nice to meet you, Tom.",
        "Hello, Tom!"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Nice to meet you é só no primeiro encontro."
    },
    {
      "type": "learn",
      "text": "I'm from Brazil.",
      "translation": "Eu sou do Brasil.",
      "rule": "Sou de… = I'm from…"
    },
    {
      "type": "learn",
      "text": "See you later! Bye!",
      "translation": "Até mais! Tchau!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Tom",
          "text": "Hi! I'm Tom.",
          "translation": "Oi! Eu sou o Tom."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ana",
          "text": "Hello, Tom. I'm Ana.",
          "translation": "Olá, Tom. Eu sou a Ana."
        },
